    <system:String x:Key="About.Title">About RevitLocalDbFix</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="About.Text">RevitLocalDbFix

A standalone Windows tool that repairs the Microsoft SQL Server Express LocalDB used by Revit Steel Connections.
It is NOT a Revit add-in: nothing is installed into Revit, and it runs on its own.

The repair flow follows the official Autodesk support articles step by step (see the Help menu).
Backups are created automatically before every change, but please keep your own backups of important data.</system:String>

